{
  "id": "1281",
  "title": "An Obedient Dog",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2021-06-20",
  "synopsis": "A smart and obedient dog is for sale.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/1281/022e600bb0b018b545b6446097296c46d1c2474a.mp3?1620220336",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "听话的狗\n\n本：老板，这只狗怎么卖？\n老板：五千块。\n本：太贵了！\n老板：这只狗非常聪明，五千块不贵了。\n本：老板，钱不是问题。最重要的是，它要听话。\n老板：那你就买对了！这只狗很听话。我卖出去十几次了，每次它都能自己回家！",
    "traditional": "聽話的狗\n\n本：老闆，這隻狗怎麼賣？\n老闆：五千塊。\n本：太貴了！\n老闆：這隻狗非常聰明，五千塊不貴了。\n本：老闆，錢不是問題。最重要的是，它要聽話。\n老闆：那你就買對了！這隻狗很聽話。我賣出去十幾次了，每次它都能自己回家！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "An Obedient Dog"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "本：老板，这只狗怎么卖？",
      "traditional": "本：老闆，這隻狗怎麼賣？",
      "pinyin": "běn lǎo bǎn zhè zhī gǒu zěn me mài",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Boss, how much is this dog?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "老板：五千块。",
      "traditional": "老闆：五千塊。",
      "pinyin": "lǎo bǎn wǔ qiān kuài",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Shop Owner: 5,000 yuan."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "本：太贵了！",
      "traditional": "本：太貴了！",
      "pinyin": "běn tài guì le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: That’s too expensive!"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "老板：这只狗非常聪明，五千块不贵了。",
      "traditional": "老闆：這隻狗非常聰明，五千塊不貴了。",
      "pinyin": "lǎo bǎn zhè zhī gǒu fēi cháng cōng ming wǔ qiān kuài bú guì le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Shop Owner: This dog is extremely clever. 5,000 yuan is not expensive."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "本：老板，钱不是问题。最重要的是，它要听话。",
      "traditional": "本：老闆，錢不是問題。最重要的是，它要聽話。",
      "pinyin": "běn lǎo bǎn qián bú shì wèn tí zuì zhòng yào de shì tā yào tīng huà",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Boss, money is not a problem. The most important thing is that it must be obedient."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "老板：那你就买对了！这只狗很听话。",
      "traditional": "老闆：那你就買對了！這隻狗很聽話。",
      "pinyin": "lǎo bǎn nà nǐ jiù mǎi duì le zhè zhī gǒu hěn tīng huà",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "我卖出去十几次了，每次它都能自己回家！",
      "traditional": "我賣出去十幾次了，每次它都能自己回家！",
      "pinyin": "wǒ mài chū qù shí jǐ cì le měi cì tā dōu néng zì jǐ huí jiā",
      "english": "Shop Owner: Then you have chosen correctly! This dog is very obedient."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "I’ve sold him something-teen times now, and every time he is able to come back home by himself!"
    }
  ],
